# Plan 40 Ф.1 Этап 5 — Linux Docker build context exclusions.

# Build artifacts (Windows-specific).
#
# THE ROOT `target/` IS THE IMPORTANT ONE, and it was missing here until
# 2026-08-23. It holds `libuv-cache/libuv.a` and `rt-archive-cache/`, both
# built by the HOST, and the container prefers the cached archive over the
# system libuv it installed from apt. Symptom when it bites: every test
# CC-FAILs with `undefined reference to __isoc23_strtol` -- host libuv
# compiled against a newer glibc, linked against 22.04's 2.35. So the image
# whose whole purpose is Linux validation (plan 44.1) was validating a
# HYBRID of two machines, and would report either a false red or a false
# green depending on what the host had lying about.
target/
nova-cli/target/
nova-cli/target_alt/
compiler-codegen/target/

# Generated C / executables. Exclude generated C from test runs,
# но НЕ из подкаталога plan40_sanitizers/ (там hand-written stress
# tests). Docker .dockerignore parses top-to-bottom; negation must
# come AFTER the exclusion to override.
nova_tests/**/*.c
nova_tests/**/*.exe
nova_tests/**/*.obj
nova_tests/**/*.pdb
!nova_tests/plan40_sanitizers/
!nova_tests/plan40_sanitizers/**

# vcpkg на Linux не используем (system libgc + libuv).
compiler-codegen/vcpkg_installed/

# Git history (не нужна для build).
.git/

# Editor / IDE.
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*.tmp

# Private repo (вне build context'а Nova).
../nova-lang-private/
